      "created_at": "2025-03-06T03:23:19.504Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just finished Conspiracy of Clones. It was okay, it didn’t really fit my groups vibe very well and I’m very happy to be onward to doing more personalized content for them.</p>\n<p>I will say i was <strong>VERY WORRIED</strong> at the end there, that fight was getting out of pocket with 1 person at 0, and everyone in single digits while Biomancer was still mostly full and had a dozen+ minions.</p>\n<p>I was like “wow this is WAY wild, I don’t think this encounter is balanced correctly.”</p>\n<p>And then the <strong>RED POWERS</strong> happened and it was glorious and epic and they did manage to Win.</p>\n<p>So I should have more faith! Great stuff!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2025-03-06T03:24:42.215Z",
