      "id": 262755,
      "name": "Chief Lackey Rich",
      "username": "Chief_Lackey_Rich",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2025-03-06T12:09:56.251Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, when the Reds kick in (especially Red combos) that’s the heroes’ time to shine.  If your players are fairly new to the game I find it can be helpful to remind them that they can opt to take a minor twist (or burn a collection) to use an ability one GYRO zone early.  It’s costly and sometimes won’t work well (like when your Reds are very combo-dependent) but popping a Red ability while you’re in Yellow has been decisive in more than a few scenes I’ve seen.</p>\n<p>And if the baddies roll hot on you round 1 it can become an option while the scene is still in the Green, even.  “I told you you wouldn’t like me when I’m angry!”</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2025-03-06T12:09:56.251Z",
