      "created_at": "2025-03-07T03:32:29.069Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, the SCRPG’s GYRO system is one of its more unique and cooler mechanics. Rather than hindering a character when they get beaten down in HP like some systems, it instead mimics the heightening tensions oft-found in superheroic stories.</p>",
